olio extravergine prodotti dal Relais Del Sol a Pacengo di Lazise. Acquistali direttamente in struttura.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0u1vv8138-u_h.ico\" sizes=\"1206x1243\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LodgingBusiness\",\"name\":\"Agriturismo Relais del Sol\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Loc. Casa Antonia, 1\",\"addressLocality\":\"Pacengo di Lazise\",\"addressRegion\":\"VR\",\"postalCode\":\"37017\",\"addressCountry\":\"IT\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":45.5083,\"longitude\":10.7378},\"telephone\":\"+390456490008\",\"priceRange\":\"€€\",\"amenityFeature\":[\"Pool\",\"Breakfast\",\"WiFi\",\"Dog Friendly\",\"Lake View\"]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-sol-cream text-sol-bark antialiased overflow-x-hidden\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-20 max-w-7xl items-center px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"w-10 md:hidden\"></div><a class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all duration-300 md:flex-none md:justify-start\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Relais Del Sol\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"font-serif text-2xl italic text-sol-cream\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\">Relais Del Sol</span></a><nav class=\"ml-10 hidden items-center gap-7 md:flex\"><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/camere\">Camere</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/agricamping\">Agriglamping</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/esperienze\">Esperienze</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/prodotti\">Prodotti</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/chi-siamo\">Chi Siamo</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/contatti\">Contatti</a></nav><div class=\"ml-auto hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-none font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-sol-bark disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 bg-sol-terracotta text-white border border-sol-terracotta hover:bg-sol-terracotta/90 h-9 px-4\" variant=\"primary\" href=\"https://be.bookingexpert.it/book/simple/noavail?hotel=42837&amp;layout=14194&amp;lang=it&amp;currency=EUR\">Prenota Ora</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ml-auto inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center md:hidden text-sol-cream\" aria-label=\"Apri menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Apri menu</span><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7H20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 12H20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 17H20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main><section class=\"relative h-[60vh] min-h-[400px] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Prodotti del Relais Del Sol\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fvino.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-sol-bark/70\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-12 left-6 md:left-16\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\"><span class=\"text-sol-cream\">Dalla nostra terra</span></span><h1 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-5xl font-light text-sol-cream md:text-6xl\">I Prodotti del Relais</h1><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-lg font-sans text-base text-sol-cream/80\">Vino, olio extravergine. Puoi degustarli in struttura e portarteli a casa.</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-sol-cream py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center\"><p class=\"font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\">Nella saletta vicino alla reception, tra le bottiglie allineate sugli scaffali, si racconta la storia di questa terra. Il vino e l&#x27;olio nascono qui, a Pacengo di Lazise, tra i vigneti e gli oliveti che circondano il Relais. Puoi degustarli durante il tuo soggiorno e portarli a casa come ricordo di un posto che non si dimentica.</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-sol-sand py-24 md:py-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-16\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\">La nostra produzione</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 mb-16 font-serif text-4xl font-light text-sol-bark md:text-5xl\">Cosa produciamo</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-20\"><article class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-0 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"relative min-h-[400px] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Vino del Relais Del Sol\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-4.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center bg-sol-cream p-10 md:p-14\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\">Dalla vigna</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl text-sol-bark\">Vino — Rosso, Bianco e Rosé</h3><p class=\"mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\">I vigneti del Relais crescono sulle colline che guardano il lago. Il risultato sono vini che parlano di questo territorio: il rosso strutturato delle colline veronesi, il bianco fresco e minerale, il rosé elegante per le serate estive. Tutti disponibili in struttura, da assaporare in veranda o da portare a casa.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-sol-sand px-4 py-2 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Vino Rosso</span><span class=\"bg-sol-sand px-4 py-2 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Vino Bianco</span><span class=\"bg-sol-sand px-4 py-2 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Vino Rosé</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 font-sans text-xs italic text-sol-bark/40\">Disponibile in struttura — assortimento soggetto a stagionalità</p></div></article><article class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-0 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"order-1 flex flex-col justify-center bg-sol-cream p-10 md:p-14\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\">Dal frantoio</span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl text-sol-bark\">Olio Extravergine di Oliva</h3><p class=\"mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\">Gli ulivi del Relais hanno radici profonde in questa terra. L&#x27;olio che ne ricaviamo è extravergine, pressato a freddo, con un profilo aromatico che ricorda il Lago di Garda: delicato, fruttato, con una leggera nota erbacea. Perfetto a crudo, su una bruschetta, o come condimento per esaltare i sapori semplici della cucina veneta.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-sol-sand px-4 py-2 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Extravergine</span><span class=\"bg-sol-sand px-4 py-2 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Pressato a freddo</span><span class=\"bg-sol-sand px-4 py-2 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Produzione propria</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 font-sans text-xs italic text-sol-bark/40\">Disponibile in struttura — quantità limitata per stagione</p></div><div class=\"order-2 relative min-h-[400px] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Olio extravergine del Relais Del Sol\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-5.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-sol-bark py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 px-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-16\"><div><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\"><span class=\"text-sol-cream/60\">Dove trovarli</span></span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-cream md:text-4xl\">Come acquistare i nostri prodotti</h2><p class=\"mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-cream/70\">Tutti i prodotti sono disponibili nella saletta espositiva vicino alla reception, aperta durante tutto il soggiorno. Puoi anche trovarli al chiosco bordo piscina durante la stagione estiva.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><article class=\"border border-sol-cream/15 bg-sol-cream/10 p-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-cream/50\">Saletta prodotti</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-sol-cream\">Vicino alla reception — aperta tutto il giorno</p></article><article class=\"border border-sol-cream/15 bg-sol-cream/10 p-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-cream/50\">Chiosco piscina</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-sol-cream\">Disponibile in stagione — 10:00/19:00</p></article><article class=\"border border-sol-cream/15 bg-sol-cream/10 p-5\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-cream/50\">Acquisto e spedizione</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-sm text-sol-cream\">Contattaci per ordini e spedizioni a domicilio</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-sol-sand py-12\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-16\"><div class=\"mb-8 text-center\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\">I nostri prodotti</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] cursor-pointer overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Prodotti del Relais Del Sol 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprodotti%2Fprodotti-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&am